{"sectionId":"stereo/conformation","items":[{"id":"stereo--conformation-k001","sectionId":"stereo/conformation","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"구조 이성질체는 분자식이 같고 연결 방식이 다르며 입체 이성질체는 연결이 같고 공간 배열이 다르다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"stereo--conformation-k002","sectionId":"stereo/conformation","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"단일결합 회전으로 바뀌는 배좌는 일반적으로 결합 절단 없이 상호전환한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"stereo--conformation-k003","sectionId":"stereo/conformation","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"Newman 투영에서 ethane의 staggered는 eclipsed보다","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"stereo--conformation-k004","sectionId":"stereo/conformation","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"안정하고 butane의 anti는 gauche보다","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"stereo--conformation-k005","sectionId":"stereo/conformation","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"대체로 안정하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"stereo--conformation-k006","sectionId":"stereo/conformation","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"비틀림 strain과 입체 strain을 구별한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"stereo--conformation-k007","sectionId":"stereo/conformation","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"cyclohexane의 chair는 angle 및 torsional strain을 최소화하는 안정 배좌다.","kind":"body-derive